        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>NIST SP 800-82r3 — Guide to Operational Technology (OT) Security</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1530px;\n    min-height: 1980px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 91px 179px 130px 180px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .page-header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    width: 100%;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.14;\n  }\n\n  .header-left {\n    width: 310px;\n  }\n\n  .header-right {\n    width: 660px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n\n  .intro {\n    margin: 31px 0 14px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.145;\n  }\n\n  .control-heading {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 34px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .control-heading .code {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .control-heading .name {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .control-table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1.12;\n  }\n\n  .control-table col.control-number {\n    width: 129px;\n  }\n\n  .control-table col.control-name {\n    width: 666px;\n  }\n\n  .control-table col.baseline {\n    width: 125.33px;\n  }\n\n  .control-table th,\n  .control-table td {\n    border: 1.35px solid #000;\n    padding: 11px 13px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  .control-table thead th {\n    background: #cecece;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .control-table thead tr:first-child th {\n    height: 56px;\n  }\n\n  .control-table thead tr:nth-child(2) th {\n    height: 55px;\n  }\n\n  .control-table .number-head {\n    line-height: 1.13;\n  }\n\n  .control-table .name-head {\n    line-height: 1.12;\n  }\n\n  .control-table .name-head .subhead {\n    display: block;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n\n  .control-table .baseline-title {\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .control-table tbody td {\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n  }\n\n  .control-table tbody .main-row td {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .control-table .enhancement {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-style: italic;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n\n  .discussion {\n    margin: 14px 0 14px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n  }\n\n  .discussion-label,\n  .enhancement-label {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .cp2-heading {\n    margin-top: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .cp2-table tbody tr {\n    height: 55px;\n  }\n\n  .cp2-table tbody tr.wrap-row {\n    height: 59px;\n  }\n\n  .cp2-table td {\n    padding-top: 8px;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .cp2-discussion {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 13px;\n  }\n\n  .enhancement-note {\n    margin: 0 0 16px;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.14;\n  }\n\n  .cp3-heading {\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n\n  .cp3-table tbody tr {\n    height: 56px;\n  }\n\n  .no-discussion {\n    margin: 15px 0 0;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 88px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"header-left\">\n      NIST SP 800-82r3<br>\n      September 2023\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"header-right\">\n      Guide to Operational Technology (OT) Security\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <p class=\"intro\">\n    be possible. When the organization cannot provide necessary essential services, support, or<br>\n    automated mechanisms during contingency operations, it should provide nonautomated<br>\n    mechanisms or predetermined procedures as compensating controls in accordance with the<br>\n    general tailoring guidance. Examples of compensating controls are given with each control as<br>\n    appropriate.\n  </p>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"control-heading\">\n      <span class=\"code\">CP-1</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">POLICY AND PROCEDURES</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <table class=\"control-table\" aria-label=\"CP-1 Policy and Procedures\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"control-number\">\n        <col class=\"control-name\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"number-head\" rowspan=\"2\">CNTL<br>NO.</th>\n          <th class=\"name-head\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            CONTROL NAME\n            <span class=\"subhead\">Control Enhancement Name</span>\n          </th>\n          <th class=\"baseline-title\" colspan=\"3\">CONTROL BASELINES</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>LOW</th>\n          <th>MOD</th>\n          <th>HIGH</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"main-row\">\n          <td>CP-1</td>\n          <td>Policy and Procedures</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <p class=\"discussion\">\n      <span class=\"discussion-label\">OT Discussion:</span> The policy specifically addresses the unique properties and requirements of OT<br>\n      and the relationship to non-OT systems.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"control-heading cp2-heading\">\n      <span class=\"code\">CP-2</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">CONTINGENCY PLAN</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <table class=\"control-table cp2-table\" aria-label=\"CP-2 Contingency Plan\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"control-number\">\n        <col class=\"control-name\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"number-head\" rowspan=\"2\">CNTL<br>NO.</th>\n          <th class=\"name-head\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            CONTROL NAME\n            <span class=\"subhead\">Control Enhancement Name</span>\n          </th>\n          <th class=\"baseline-title\" colspan=\"3\">CONTROL BASELINES</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>LOW</th>\n          <th>MOD</th>\n          <th>HIGH</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"main-row\">\n          <td>CP-2</td>\n          <td>Contingency Plan</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>CP-2 (1)</td>\n          <td class=\"enhancement\">CONTINGENCY PLAN | COORDINATE WITH RELATED PLANS</td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>CP-2 (2)</td>\n          <td class=\"enhancement\">CONTINGENCY PLAN | CAPACITY PLANNING</td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>CP-2 (3)</td>\n          <td class=\"enhancement\">CONTINGENCY PLAN | RESUME MISSION AND BUSINESS FUNCTIONS</td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"wrap-row\">\n          <td>CP-2 (5)</td>\n          <td class=\"enhancement\">CONTINGENCY PLAN | CONTINUE MISSION AND BUSINESS<br>FUNCTIONS</td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>CP-2 (8)</td>\n          <td class=\"enhancement\">CONTINGENCY PLAN | IDENTIFY CRITICAL ASSETS</td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <p class=\"discussion cp2-discussion\">\n      <span class=\"discussion-label\">OT Discussion:</span> The organization defines contingency plans for categories of disruptions or<br>\n      failures. In the case of a contingency, the OT equipment executes preprogrammed functions,<br>\n      such as alerting the operator of the failure and then doing nothing, alerting the operator and then<br>\n      safely shutting down the industrial process, or alerting the operator and then maintaining the last<br>\n      operational setting prior to failure. Contingency plans for widespread disruption may involve<br>\n      specialized organizations (e.g., FEMA, emergency services, regulatory authorities).\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"enhancement-note\">\n      <span class=\"enhancement-label\">Control Enhancement:</span> (1) (2) (3) (5) (8) No OT Discussion for this control.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2 class=\"control-heading cp3-heading\">\n      <span class=\"code\">CP-3</span>\n      <span class=\"name\">CONTINGENCY TRAINING</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <table class=\"control-table cp3-table\" aria-label=\"CP-3 Contingency Training\">\n      <colgroup>\n        <col class=\"control-number\">\n        <col class=\"control-name\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n        <col class=\"baseline\">\n      </colgroup>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th class=\"number-head\" rowspan=\"2\">CNTL<br>NO.</th>\n          <th class=\"name-head\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            CONTROL NAME\n            <span class=\"subhead\">Control Enhancement Name</span>\n          </th>\n          <th class=\"baseline-title\" colspan=\"3\">CONTROL BASELINES</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <th>LOW</th>\n          <th>MOD</th>\n          <th>HIGH</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr class=\"main-row\">\n          <td>CP-3</td>\n          <td>Contingency Training</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>CP-3 (1)</td>\n          <td class=\"enhancement\">CONTINGENCY TRAINING | SIMULATED EVENTS</td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td></td>\n          <td>Select</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <p class=\"no-discussion\">No OT Discussion for this control.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">248</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
